---
name: bosun-up
description: Bring up a profile or autoStart set. Cascades dependencies and blocks until each app is healthy (120s budget).
bosun-version: {{bosun_version}}
generated-at: {{generated_at}}
---

Run: `bosun up $1` (or just `bosun up` to use autoStart).

Returns an array of `{ name, status, health }`. Any entry with `status != "serving"` or `health != "healthy"` indicates a failure — follow up with `bosun errors <name>` and `bosun why <name>`.
